<title>VENEZUELA: Vencemos Q1 net up 7.0 percent.</title>
<headline>Vencemos Q1 net up 7.0 percent.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1st quarter 1997     1st quarter, 1996</p>
<p>    Net profit	 10.146 bln bolivars     9.654 bln</p>
<p>    Net sales	  39.283 bln bolivars    42.938 bln</p>
<p>    Operating costs   3.429 bln bolivars     3.267 bln</p>
<p>    Revenues	   10.29 bln bolivars	 9.48 bln</p>
<p>    Total costs	8.73 bln bolivars	10.95 bln</p>
<p>NOTE: Results to period ending March 31 are consolidated but preliminary and not audited. All results are expressed in constant March 31, 1997 bolivars.</p>
<p>Vencemos Corporation SA is a cement-producing subsidiary of Mexican cement group Cemex SA</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
